OL,3,GNEWSAResidents want rid of 'really sad'
OL,4,AChristmas tree
OL,5,
OL,6,FA petition has been launched to remove
OL,7,Fand replace a "really sad" Christmas
OL,8,Ftree in Doncaster.
OL,10,FThe living tree, in the middle of
OL,11,FMexborough's Adwick Road roundabout,
OL,12,Fhas been described as "droopy and
OL,13,Fsaggy" by community group Spirit of
OL,14,FMexborough.
OL,16,FIt was planted in 2022, funded by
OL,17,F#1,050 of public money, but a local
OL,18,Fbusinessman has now offered to pay for
OL,19,Fa new 24ft (7.3m) fully lit tree to go
OL,20,Fin its place.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
