OL,3,GNEWSAResidents want rid of 'really sad'
OL,4,AChristmas tree
OL,5,
OL,6,FCity of Doncaster Council argued that
OL,7,Falthough some might not find the tree
OL,8,F"aesthetically pleasing", it remained
OL,9,F"healthy and remains capable of
OL,10,Fsustained growth".
